activity-receipts = Caller-reported execution receipts
activity-receipts-caveat = Immutable caller reports, not OS-confirmed mutation evidence or proof that the goal was completed. Errors and indeterminate results do not prove that no effects occurred. No report grants permission or starts an operation.
activity-receipts-refresh = Refresh receipts
activity-receipts-load-hint = Refresh to load stored reports from Claw OS. This does not execute an App.
activity-receipts-empty = No caller-reported receipts are recorded for this Activity.
activity-receipts-limit = Showing up to 100 receipts.
activity-receipt-caller-reported = CALLER-REPORTED
activity-receipt-returned = Returned
activity-receipt-reported-error = Reported error
activity-receipt-indeterminate = Indeterminate
activity-receipt-id = Receipt ID
activity-receipt-recorded = Recorded at
